<font face="Segoe UI" size="25"><b>Ngủ cùng em.</b></font>

311
00:20:36,830 --> 00:20:38,540
<font face="Segoe UI" size="25"><b>Ơ-Ơ kìa...</b></font>

312
00:20:39,460 --> 00:20:40,550
<font face="Segoe UI" size="25"><b>Kousuke.</b></font>

313
00:20:41,210 --> 00:20:42,380
<font face="Segoe UI" size="25"><b>Quay mặt sang phía chị đi.</b></font>

314
00:20:44,510 --> 00:20:45,340
