342
00:21:46,700 --> 00:21:48,570
<font face="Segoe UI" size="25"><b><i>Trái tim mình đã sẵn sàng rồi.</i></b></font>

343
00:21:51,740 --> 00:21:52,660
<font face="Segoe UI" size="25"><b>Chị ơi?</b></font>

344
00:22:00,290 --> 00:22:03,250
<font face="Segoe UI" size="25"><b>Chị ấy... ngủ mất rồi à?</b></font>

345
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:07,760
<font face="Segoe UI" size="25"><b>Còn mình thì...</b></font>

346
00:22:08,550 --> 00:22:09,680
